From f4f3afb093b20cbba22fe430799cd5de38a6e9ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:17:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] v850: Vectorize float code with the FXU

Use V4SF for float with the FXU and add the min, max, compare, select,
permute, lane, reduction and rounding patterns the vectorizer needs,
with costs. Keep float code scalar when the rounding mode can change.

Signed-off-by: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
